# ByteBites System Design
Verified UML-style class diagram.
Four classes, related by composition (has-a containers), never inheritance (is-a).

## Classes

### Customer
- name: str
- purchase_history: list[Order]
- Methods: add_order(order)
<!-- is_verified: bool -->

### FoodItem
- name: str
- price: float
- category: str
- popularity_rating: float

### Menu
- items: list[FoodItem]
- Methods: add_item(item), calculate_total()
<!-- filter_by_category(category) list[FoodItem] -->

### Order
- items: list[FoodItem]
- Methods: add_item(item), calculate_total()

## Relationships
- - `Menu` **contains** `FoodItem` objects (composition).
- `Order` **contains** `FoodItem` objects (composition).
- `Customer` **has** a `purchase_history` of `Order` objects (composition).

